sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant K as Kubelet
    participant DP as Data plane<br/>serve_and_drain
    participant N as New stream request<br/>(attach / SSE / ECW / upgrade)
    participant L as Live streams<br/>(child of stream_shutdown_token)

    K->>DP: SIGTERM (shutdown_token)
    DP->>DP: drain_started cancelled<br/>listener stops accepting
    Note over DP: new connections (probes too) refused<br/>idle keep-alive connections close
    N->>DP: request already in flight
    DP-->>N: 503 + Retry-After: 1<br/>(+ Connection: close on HTTP/1)<br/>unattached WebSocket: close 1012
    L-->>L: keep running untouched
    alt every stream ends before the deadline
        L->>DP: last connection / tracked task finishes
        DP->>K: exit early
    else --shutdown-grace-secs set and passed, or a second stop signal
        DP->>L: cancel stream_shutdown_token
        Note over L: native SSE: body ends → reconnect with Last-Event-ID<br/>(live resume, missed output not replayed)<br/>native WebSocket: close 1012<br/>ECW connect: unavailable end-stream → reconnect<br/>(unreported start: unknown, no retry)<br/>streamed StreamInput: 409<br/>other upgrades: closed
        DP->>K: exit (after ≤ 5s cancel grace)
    end
